# NetAura VPN Account Deletion

Effective date: May 4, 2026

If you use NetAura VPN and want your VPN account and associated backend data deleted, you can request deletion by contacting:

- Email: contact.topleveldevelopers@gmail.com
- Subject line: `NetAura VPN Account Deletion Request`

Please include enough information for us to identify your account, such as:

- the app name: NetAura VPN
- your VPN account ID, if available
- the email address or contact channel you want us to use to confirm the request

What happens after a request:

- We will review the request and verify it where needed.
- We will delete or anonymize account-related backend data that is no longer required for security, fraud prevention, legal compliance, or legitimate operational recordkeeping.
- Data stored locally on your own device can also be removed by uninstalling the app or clearing app storage in Android settings.

Retention exceptions:

- We may retain limited information where necessary for legal obligations, abuse prevention, fraud prevention, dispute handling, or security investigations.

Questions:

- Contact contact.topleveldevelopers@gmail.com
